6:59:00.000Z","items":[],"featured":[],"pulls":0,"source":"api"},{"id":"wuwa:event:kuro:Cubie Wars:2026-09-30","gameId":"wuwa","kind":"event","title":"Cubie Wars","image":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dmwizbdlc/image/upload/v1791591769/ev2soqhiv4agpr2j8amb.png","start":"2026-09-30T03:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T16:59:59.000Z","items":[],"featured":[],"pulls":0,"official":true,"source":"api","description":"You can unlock various Cubie Warriors by progressing through stages and challenging different foes. During the event, complete Adventure Goals to win Stage Badges. When the total number of Stage Badges reaches specific milestones, more rewards will unlock. Clear stages to win Show Coins, which can be used to redeem various rewards at the Backstage Store."},{"id":"wuwa:event:kuro:Dreams in the Capsule:2026-09-30","gameId":"wuwa","kind":"event","title":"Dreams in the Capsule","image":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dmwizbdlc/image/upload/v1791591333/g4yyyt0luvauucpekpor.png","start":"2026-09-30T03:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T08:59:59.000Z","items":[],"featured":[],"pulls":0,"official":true,"source":"api","description":"The event consists of 4 phases, unlocked in sequence as you progress through the Main Quest. In each phase, you complete event tasks, including puzzle solving, combat, and item collecting, to unlock and obtain rewards based on the number of CSC Cipherlocks obtained."},{"id":"wuwa:event:kuro:Echo Erase:2026-10-22","gameId":"wuwa","kind":"event","title":"Echo Erase","image":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dmwizbdlc/image/upload/v1791591140/vrgqnmaxji9gu2t2rrjp.png","start":"2026-10-22T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T08:59:59.000Z","items":[],"featured":[],"pulls":0,"official":true,"source":"api","description":"During the event, stages become available daily. Each stage has two difficulties: Easy and Hard. Complete the Easy difficulty to unlock the Hard challenge. Complete the goals of each stage to earn rewards."},{"id":"wuwa:event:kuro:Beyond the Waves: Land of Xuanfang:2026-10-29","gameId":"wuwa","kind":"event","title":"Beyond the Waves: Land of Xuanfang","image":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dmwizbdlc/image/upload/v1791591106/uehuwjzuvb4kzzcgyvmt.png","start":"2026-10-29T09:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T08:59:59.000Z","items":[],"featured":[],"pulls":0,"official":true,"source":"api","description":"During the event, complete event tasks once per day to obtain a set number of Adventure Logs. Each Adventure Log can be exchanged for an Adventure Package. Adventure Packages contain special mechanics that, when triggered, unlock a large amount of rewards. There are 3 Inventories for the Adventure Packages. Once you collect all deliveries in an Inventory, the next Inventory will be unlocked."},{"id":"wuwa:event:kuro:Gifts of Waking Moon:2026-09-30","gameId":"wuwa","kind":"event","title":"Gifts of Waking Moon","image":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dmwizbdlc/image/upload/v1791591587/vo6zjktvizhps5fx8nzo.png","start":"2026-09-30T03:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T08:59:59.000Z","items":[],"featured":[],"pulls":0,"official":true,"source":"api","description":"During the event, log in to claim the day's login rewards."},{"id":"wuwa:event:kuro:Gifts of Singing Drizzle:2026-10-22","gameId":"wuwa","kind":"event","title":"Gifts of Singing Drizzle","image":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dmwizbdlc/image/upload/v1791591496/vgpzit1y7d47cu0t5kx2.png","start":"2026-10-22T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T08:59:59.000Z","items":[{"name":"Radiant Tide","amount":10,"icon":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f0/Item_Radiant_Tide.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20240523074327"},{"name":"Premium Tuner","amount":100,"icon":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e1/Item_Premium_Tuner.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20240529094703"},{"name":"Crystal Solvent","amount":5,"icon":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/4d/Item_Crystal_Solvent.png/revision/latest/scale-to-wi